: "subtitle", "time": 5390.55, "timestamp": "01:29:50", "text": "嗯，我得坐下来把这些问题都解决掉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5392.31, "timestamp": "01:29:52", "text": "。[笑]真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5394.149, "timestamp": "01:29:54", "text": "麻烦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5397.11, "timestamp": "01:29:57", "text": "不过，我今天玩得很开心。谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.59, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "大家抽出时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5404.709, "timestamp": "01:30:04", "text": "来观看我的直播并支持我。这对我意义重大。也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5406.79, "timestamp": "01:30:06", "text": "谢谢大家和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5409.75, "timestamp": "01:30:09", "text": "我聊天。总之，明天见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5413.75, "timestamp": "01:30:13", "text": "明天就是明天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5415.91, "timestamp": "01:30:15", "text": "，对吧？嗯。嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5422.149, "timestamp": "01:30:22", "text": "我可能会玩《堡垒之夜》。不确定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5426.47, "timestamp": "01:30:26", "text": "看情况。也许是弧光。谁知道呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5430.229, "timestamp": "01:30:30", "text": "嗨。话虽如此，我会等。就到此为止吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5467.91, "timestamp": "01:31:07", "text": "好的。嗨。祝大家一切顺利。谢谢。谢谢。谢谢。"}]}